Table full name: mitelman-db.prod.MolBiolClinAssoc
Column name: MolClin Type: STRING Description: this flag indicates whether this row describes a molecular 'M' or clinical 'C' association
Column name: RefNo Type: INT64 Description: reference number, eg '15563'
